{"uid":"estorides_core/ontology.py","name":"ontology.py","qualname":"estorides_core/ontology.py","kind":"module","file":"estorides_core/ontology.py","line":1,"end_line":397,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"estorides_core.ontology ======================= The \"centralized ontology engine\" — the brain of the platform.","description":"Three things live here:\n\n  SanctionsIndex\n    OFAC SDN list, mirrored from OpenSanctions\n    (https://www.opensanctions.org/datasets/latest/us_ofac_sdn/targets.simple.csv).\n    Loaded on first use, refreshed every 24h, single-flight so\n    concurrent requests share one fetch. ~7 MB, low-tens-of-thousands\n    of entries. In-memory graph: {entry} by id + by normalised name\n    + by alias + by crypto address.\n\n  WikidataCache\n    A bounded LRU over the Wikidata SPARQL endpoint. Used to\n    canonicalise \"Vladimir Putin\" → Q7747, \"FSB\" → Q2084917, etc.\n    24h TTL per entry, capped at 10k items to bound memory.\n\n  OntologyEngine\n    The orchestrator-facing facade. Exposes:\n        - resolve(name) -> candidate sanction matches\n        - resolve_crypto_address(addr) -> sanction cross-check\n        - check_observation(obs) -> {hits, hits_by_field}\n    Designed to be called from a new \"post-process\" stage that\n    decorates each observation with a sanctions verdict before the\n    LLM analyst sees it.\n\nThis module is deliberately dependency-light (only stdlib). The CSV\nparser is hand-rolled and tolerant of double-quoted fields with\nembedded commas and newlines — the OpenSanctions export is well-\nformed so we don't need `csv` module gymnastics, but we do need the\n\"\"\" escape\" support that the csv module handles. Using the stdlib\nreader keeps the dependency surface to zero.\n\nSpec reference: https://www.opensanctions.org/datasets/us_ofac_sdn/","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["estorides_core/ontology.py::SDN_CSV_URL","estorides_core/ontology.py::SDN_LOCAL_CACHE","estorides_core/ontology.py::SDN_TTL_SECONDS","estorides_core/ontology.py::WIKIDATA_TTL_SECONDS","estorides_core/ontology.py::WIKIDATA_LRU_MAX","estorides_core/ontology.py::WIKIDATA_ENDPOINT","estorides_core/ontology.py::WIKIDATA_UA","estorides_core/ontology.py::SanctionEntry","estorides_core/ontology.py::SanctionsIndex","estorides_core/ontology.py::WikidataCache","estorides_core/ontology.py::OntologyEngine"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
